Restore, persist, and clear Ask conversations per browser via localStorage only:
bounded to 20 messages / 2000 chars, mode-scoped keys, versioned payloads,
invalid-role and garbage payload rejection, no server-side storage. Sessions
restore on return visits unless a prompted question is being auto-submitted.
